@startuml exceptions
title 任务 13 · V4.0 MVC：业务异常继承明细\ncom.campus.reservation · common / exception
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty members
set separator none
left to right direction
class RuntimeException <<JDK>>
package common #FDEEEE {
  class BusinessException {
    - {static} serialVersionUID : long
    + BusinessException(message : String)
  }
}
package exception #FFF4E4 {
  class EmptyParameterException
  class PasswordErrorException
  class PermissionDeniedException
  class ReserveCancelException
  class ReserveConflictException
  class ReserveRecordNotFoundException
  class ReserveStatusTransitionException
  class ResourceNotFoundException
  class ResourceReservedException
  class ResourceUnavailableException
  class UserAlreadyExistsException
  class UserNotFoundException
}
RuntimeException <|-- BusinessException
BusinessException <|-- EmptyParameterException
BusinessException <|-- PasswordErrorException
BusinessException <|-- PermissionDeniedException
BusinessException <|-- ReserveCancelException
BusinessException <|-- ReserveConflictException
BusinessException <|-- ReserveRecordNotFoundException
BusinessException <|-- ReserveStatusTransitionException
BusinessException <|-- ResourceNotFoundException
BusinessException <|-- ResourceReservedException
BusinessException <|-- ResourceUnavailableException
BusinessException <|-- UserAlreadyExistsException
BusinessException <|-- UserNotFoundException
note bottom of BusinessException
  BusinessException 归入 common，原异常子类保留在 exception。
  服务边界捕获业务/IO 异常并返回 Result.fail。
  控制器包装业务异常，View 展示中文消息；DAO 不处理权限和预约规则。
end note
@enduml
